c Mutual exclusion: 4 processes, at most 1 in critical section
c Combined with requirement that at least 2 are in CS simultaneously
c Known UNSAT - contradicts mutex
c Variables: p1..p4 = process i in critical section
p cnf 4 11
c At least 2 processes in CS (at-least-2 encoding)
c Require p_i AND p_j for some pair
c This is: (p1 OR p2 OR p3) AND (p1 OR p2 OR p4) AND
c          (p1 OR p3 OR p4) AND (p2 OR p3 OR p4)
1 2 3 0
1 2 4 0
1 3 4 0
2 3 4 0
c At least one specific pair must be true (strengthening)
c p1 AND p2, OR p1 AND p3, OR p2 AND p3, etc.
c Force p1: must be in CS
1 0
c Force p2: must be in CS
2 0
c Mutual exclusion: at most 1 in CS
-1 -2 0
-1 -3 0
-1 -4 0
-2 -3 0
-2 -4 0
